  symbolText: "Одна оболочка. Твоя атмосфера.",
  factOne: "НАТИВНЫЙ ИНТЕРФЕЙС",
  factTwo: "СВОБОДА ОФОРМЛЕНИЯ",
  factThree: "ОТКРЫТЫЙ КОД",
  screenshotEyebrow: "01 / НАСТОЯЩИЙ ИНТЕРФЕЙС",
  screenshotTitle: "Не концепт.",
  screenshotTitleEm: "Твоя будущая система.",
  screenshotDesc: "Подлинные снимки запущенной оболочки. Выбери экран, чтобы рассмотреть, как интерфейс работает вместе — от рабочего стола до настроек.",
  captureNote: "Скриншоты работающего Quickshell из тестового сеанса; эффекты и производительность зависят от конфигурации Hyprland.",
  philosophyEyebrow: "02 / ФИЛОСОФИЯ",
  philosophyHeading: "Меньше шума.",
  philosophyHeadingEm: "Больше пространства.",
  philosophyText: "Красота — не в количестве панелей. Она в точном расстоянии между ними, в спокойных цветах, в движении, которое никогда не требует внимания.",
  featureEyebrow: "03 / СДЕЛАНО ДЛЯ ТЕБЯ",
  featureTitle: "Твой способ",
  featureTitleEm: "чувствовать рабочий стол.",
  featureIntro: "Один язык оформления объединяет повседневные инструменты — без визуального хаоса и повторяющихся элементов.",
  feat1Eyebrow: "01 / ЦВЕТ",
  feat1Title: "Цвет из атмосферы.",
  feat1Body: "Wallpaper Studio 2.0, коллекции, избранное и необязательная адаптивная палитра. Обои задают тон, но выбор всегда остаётся за тобой.",
  feat2Eyebrow: "02 / КОМПОЗИЦИЯ",
  feat2Title: "Панель под твои задачи.",
  feat2Body: "Настраиваемые Bar и Dock, размещение модулей, виджеты рабочего стола и несколько стилистических направлений.",
  feat3Eyebrow: "03 / КОНТЕКСТ",
  feat3Title: "Режим под момент.",
  feat3Body: "Balanced, Focus, Work и Gaming меняют временные настройки, не разрушая твою основную конфигурацию.",
  feat4Eyebrow: "04 / МУЗЫКА",
  feat4Title: "Музыка остаётся рядом.",
  feat4Body: "MPRIS-плеер и тексты песен. В версии 1.3-dev можно отдельно расположить плеер для рабочего стола и игр.",
  moodEyebrow: "04 / ПАЛИТРЫ",
  moodHeading: "Найди свой",
  moodHeadingEm: "оттенок тишины.",
  moodDesc: "Небольшая интерактивная иллюстрация характерных настроений Raohane. Это визуальный эскиз, а не скриншот рабочего стола.",
  moodSelect: "ВЫБЕРИ ПАЛИТРУ",
  demoLabel: "ИЛЛЮСТРАЦИЯ ОФОРМЛЕНИЯ",
  moodCards: "Отображение палитры",
  mediaCaption: "ТИХИЕ ЧАСТОТЫ",
  mediaAuthor: "RAOHANE / AUDIO",
  viewThemes: "Изучить возможности",
  closerEyebrow: "05 / НАТИВНЫЕ ИНСТРУМЕНТЫ",
  closerHeading: "Всё важное.",
  closerHeadingEm: "Ничего лишнего.",
  closerDesc: "Launcher, Control Center и Context Island используют общие сервисы и состояния. Управляй музыкой, подключениями, уведомлениями и текущей задачей без постоянного переключения между окнами.",
  closerLink: "Все возможности",
  finalEyebrow: "06 / НАЧНИ СВОЮ ИСТОРИЮ",
  finalHeading: "Дай своему рабочему",
  finalHeadingEm: "столу характер.",
  finalDesc: "Raohane находится в активной разработке. Установщик проверит зависимости и покажет изменения перед установкой. Для Arch Linux, CachyOS и других совместимых Hyprland-систем.",
  copy: "Копировать",
  copied: "Скопировано",
  copyError: "Выдели команду",
  guide: "Инструкция по установке",
  repo: "Исходники",
  footnote: "1.3.0-dev · Активная разработка, не сертифицированный стабильный релиз",
  screenshotLabel: "Рабочий стол Raohane — настоящий снимок"
} : {
  title: "Raohane — Your desktop, your atmosphere",
  description: "Raohane is an atmospheric Hyprland and Quickshell desktop shell with wallpaper-aware colors, native controls, Wallpaper Studio and Widget Studio.",
  top: "NATIVE DESKTOP SHELL / HYPRLAND",
  source: "VIEW SOURCE ON GITHUB",
  above: "BUILT FOR YOUR OWN SPACE",
  hero1: "A desktop",
  hero2: "in your rhythm.",
  heroDesc: "Raohane brings a little intention to Hyprland: composed surfaces, wallpaper-aware color, personal widgets and native controls, all exactly where they belong.",
  install: "Install Raohane",
  explore: "Explore the shell",
  symbolAlt: "Official Raohane feather-nova emblem",
  symbolLabel: "THE ORIGINAL RAOHANE EMBLEM",
  symbolText: "One shell. Your atmosphere.",
  factOne: "NATIVE RUNTIME",
  factTwo: "PERSONAL BY DESIGN",
  factThree: "OPEN SOURCE",
  screenshotEyebrow: "01 / THE REAL INTERFACE",
  screenshotTitle: "Not a concept.",
  screenshotTitleEm: "A living desktop.",
  screenshotDesc: "Actual captures of the running shell. Move between desktop, controls, launcher and settings to see how the experience comes together.",
  captureNote: "Real Quickshell captures from a diagnostic session; compositor effects and performance depend on the Hyprland system.",
  philosophyEyebrow: "02 / OUR PHILOSOPHY",
  philosophyHeading: "Less noise.",
  philosophyHeadingEm: "More room to think.",
  philosophyText: "A beautiful desktop is not about adding more panels. It's about knowing what to leave out, when to move, and when to stay perfectly still.",
  featureEyebrow: "03 / MADE FOR YOU",
  featureTitle: "A different way",
  featureTitleEm: "to feel at home.",
  featureIntro: "One visual language brings everyday tools together without a collection of disconnected surfaces.",
  feat1Eyebrow: "01 / COLOR",
  feat1Title: "Color with a sense of place.",
  feat1Body: "Wallpaper Studio 2.0, collections, favorites and optional adaptive accents. The wallpaper sets the mood while you remain in control.",
  feat2Eyebrow: "02 / COMPOSITION",
  feat2Title: "Space that fits your day.",
  feat2Body: "Configurable Bar and Dock, movable modules, desktop widgets and multiple carefully tuned visual treatments.",
  feat3Eyebrow: "03 / CONTEXT",
  feat3Title: "A mode for the moment.",
  feat3Body: "Balanced, Focus, Work and Gaming apply reversible behavior without rewriting your chosen desktop defaults.",
  feat4Eyebrow: "04 / MUSIC",
  feat4Title: "Music has a place, too.",
  feat4Body: "An MPRIS player and lyrics experience. The 1.3-dev cycle adds independent player placement for desktop and games.",
  moodEyebrow: "04 / COLOR STUDIES",
  moodHeading: "Find your",
  moodHeadingEm: "kind of quiet.",
  moodDesc: "A small interactive illustration of Raohane's visual moods. A design study, not a capture of the live desktop.",
  moodSelect: "CHOOSE AN ATMOSPHERE",
  demoLabel: "ILLUSTRATIVE COLOR STUDY",
  moodCards: "Palette illustration",
  mediaCaption: "QUIET FREQUENCIES",
  mediaAuthor: "RAOHANE / AUDIO",
  viewThemes: "Explore all features",
  closerEyebrow: "05 / NATIVE TOOLS",
  closerHeading: "Everything essential.",
  closerHeadingEm: "Nothing in the way.",
  closerDesc: "Launcher, Control Center and Context Island share native state and services. Music, connections, notifications and the current task remain close, without demanding constant attention.",
  closerLink: "Explore features",
  finalEyebrow: "06 / BEGIN HERE",
  finalHeading: "Give your desktop",
  finalHeadingEm: "a point of view.",
  finalDesc: "Raohane is in active development. The guided installer checks dependencies and explains changes before installation. Made for Arch Linux, CachyOS and compatible Hyprland setups.",
  copy: "Copy",
  copied: "Copied",
  copyError: "Select text",
  guide: "Installation guide",
  repo: "Source code",
  footnote: "1.3.0-dev · Active development, not a certified stable release",
  screenshotLabel: "Raohane desktop — actual capture"
};
const moodItems = [
  {id:"nocturne",label:"Nocturne",description:ru?"Лаванда / графит":"Lavender / graphite"},
  {id:"rose",label:"Rose Glass",description:ru?"Пепельная роза":"Ash rose"},
  {id:"sage",label:"Sage Glass",description:ru?"Шалфей / туман":"Sage / mist"},
  {id:"midnight",label:"Midnight",description:ru?"Полночный индиго":"Midnight indigo"}
];
---

<BaseLayout lang={lang} title={t.title} description={t.description}>
  <div class="page-shell ra-home">
    <SiteHeader active="home" lang={lang}/>

    <main id="main-content">
      <section class="ra-hero shell-width" aria-labelledby="ra-hero-title">
        <div class="ra-hero-topline">
          <span><i class="ra-live-dot" aria-hidden="true"></i>{t.top}</span>
          <a href={github} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">{t.source} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="ra-hero-grid">
          <div class="ra-hero-copy">
            <p class="ra-eyebrow">{t.above} <span aria-hidden="true">/ 2026</span></p>
            <h1 id="ra-hero-title">{t.hero1}<br/><em>{t.hero2}</em></h1>
            <p class="ra-hero-lede">{t.heroDesc}</p>
            <div class="ra-hero-actions">
              <a class="ra-button ra-button-primary" href={prefix+"install/"}>{t.install}<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
              <a class="ra-button ra-button-text" href="#experience">{t.explore}<span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
            </div>
            <p class="ra-hero-version">{t.footnote}</p>
          </div>

          <div class="ra-brand-stage" aria-label={t.symbolAlt}>
            <div class="ra-brand-orbits" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
            <div class="ra-brand-core">
              <img src={base+"brand/raohane-logo.svg"} alt={t.symbolAlt} width="256" height="256" fetchpriority="high"/>
            </div>
            <div class="ra-brand-caption">
              <span>{t.symbolLabel}</span>
              <small>{t.symbolText}</small>
            </div>
            <span class="ra-brand-index" aria-hidden="true">R — 01</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ra-hero-facts" aria-label="Raohane project facts">
          <span><b>01</b> {t.factOne} <strong>Hyprland + Quickshell</strong></span>
          <span><b>02</b> {t.factTwo} <strong>Wallpaper · Widgets · Scenes</strong></span>
          <span><b>03</b> {t.factThree} <strong>GPL-3.0</strong></span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="ra-experience shell-width" id="experience" aria-labelledby="ra-experience-title">
        <div class="ra-section-heading">
          <div><span class="ra-section-index">{t.screenshotEyebrow}</span><h2 id="ra-experience-title">{t.screenshotTitle}<br/><em>{t.screenshotTitleEm}</em></h2></div>
          <p>{t.screenshotDesc}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ra-experience-stage"><ShellPreview lang={lang}/></div>
        <p class="ra-capture-note"><span aria-hidden="true">↳</span> {t.captureNote}</p>
      </section>

      <section class="ra-philosophy shell-width" aria-labelledby="ra-philosophy-title">
        <div class="ra-philosophy-side"><span class="ra-section-index">{t.philosophyEyebrow}</span><span class="ra-philosophy-symbol" aria-hidden="true">✦</span></div>
        <div class="ra-philosophy-body">
          <h2 id="ra-philosophy-title">{t.philosophyHeading}<br/><em>{t.philosophyHeadingEm}</em></h2>
          <p>{t.philosophyText}</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="ra-features shell-width" aria-labelledby="ra-features-title">
        <div class="ra-section-heading">
          <div><span class="ra-section-index">{t.featureEyebrow}</span><h2 id="ra-features-title">{t.featureTitle}<br/><em>{t.featureTitleEm}</em></h2></div>
          <p>{t.featureIntro}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ra-feature-grid">
          <article class="ra-feature-card ra-feature-color">
            <div class="ra-feature-copy"><span class="ra-feature-kicker">{t.feat1Eyebrow}</span><h3>{t.feat1Title}</h3><p>{t.feat1Body}</p></div>
            <div class="ra-color-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="ra-color-orb"></div><div class="ra-color-arc"></div><div class="ra-color-palette"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div>
          </article>
          <article class="ra-feature-card ra-feature-layout">
            <div class="ra-feature-copy"><span class="ra-feature-kicker">{t.feat2Eyebrow}</span><h3>{t.feat2Title}</h3><p>{t.feat2Body}</p></div>
            <div class="ra-feature-screenshot"><img src={base+"screenshots/settings-800.webp"} alt={ru?"Настройки Raohane — скриншот работающей оболочки":"Actual Raohane settings screenshot"} width="800" height="450" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div>
          </article>
          <article class="ra-feature-card ra-feature-scenes">
            <div class="ra-feature-copy"><span class="ra-feature-kicker">{t.feat3Eyebrow}</span><h3>{t.feat3Title}</h3><p>{t.feat3Body}</p></div>
            <div class="ra-scenes-art" aria-hidden="true"><span>Balanced <i>◉</i></span><span>Focus <i>◌</i></span><span>Work <i>◧</i></span><span>Gaming <i>◇</i></span></div>
          </article>
          <article class="ra-feature-card ra-feature-music">
            <div class="ra-feature-copy"><span class="ra-feature-kicker">{t.feat4Eyebrow}</span><h3>{t.feat4Title}</h3><p>{t.feat4Body}</p></div>
            <div class="ra-music-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="ra-record"><span>✦</span></div><div class="ra-music-text"><small>MPRIS / AUDIO</small><b>Now playing</b><div><i></i></div><span>◁ &nbsp;&nbsp; ▷ &nbsp;&nbsp; ▷|</span></div></div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="ra-moods" data-ra-moods data-palette="nocturne" aria-labelledby="ra-moods-title">
        <div class="shell-width ra-mood-inner">
          <div class="ra-mood-copy">
            <span class="ra-section-index">{t.moodEyebrow}</span>
            <h2 id="ra-moods-title">{t.moodHeading}<br/><em>{t.moodHeadingEm}</em></h2>
            <p>{t.moodDesc}</p>
            <div class="ra-mood-options" role="group" aria-label={t.moodSelect}>
              {moodItems.map((m,index)=>(
                <button type="button" data-ra-palette={m.id} aria-pressed={index===0?"true":"false"}>
                  <span class={"ra-mood-dot ra-mood-dot-"+m.id} aria-hidden="true"></span>
                  <span><b>{m.label}</b><small>{m.description}</small></span>
                </button>
              ))}
            </div>
            <a class="ra-inline-link" href={prefix+"features/"}>{t.viewThemes} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          </div>
          <div class="ra-mood-preview" role="img" aria-label={t.moodCards}>
            <div class="ra-mood-scene"><div class="ra-mood-disc"></div><div class="ra-mood-horizon"></div></div>
            <div class="ra-mood-floating-bar" aria-hidden="true"><img src={base+"brand/raohane-logo.svg"} width="21" height="21" alt=""/><span>01 &nbsp; 02 &nbsp; 03</span><span>⌘ &nbsp; ◉ &nbsp; 08:42</span></div>
            <div class="ra-mood-clock" aria-hidden="true"><span>RAOHANE / 01</span><strong>08:42</strong><small>{t.demoLabel}</small></div>
            <div class="ra-mood-floating-player" aria-hidden="true"><div class="ra-mini-art">✦</div><div><small>{t.mediaAuthor}</small><b>{t.mediaCaption}</b><i></i></div><span>Ⅱ</span></div>
            <div class="ra-mood-label" aria-hidden="true"><span data-ra-mood-name>Nocturne</span><b>◈</b></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="ra-detail shell-width" aria-labelledby="ra-detail-title">
        <div class="ra-detail-image">
          <a href={base+"screenshots/control-center.webp"} data-gallery aria-label={ru?"Открыть скриншот Control Center":"Open Control Center screenshot"}>
            <img src={base+"screenshots/control-center-800.webp"} alt={ru?"Raohane Control Center — настоящий скриншот":"Real Raohane Control Center screenshot"} width="800" height="450" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/>
          </a>
          <span>RAOHANE / CONTROL CENTER</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ra-detail-copy">
          <span class="ra-section-index">{t.closerEyebrow}</span>
          <h2 id="ra-detail-title">{t.closerHeading}<br/><em>{t.closerHeadingEm}</em></h2>
          <p>{t.closerDesc}</p>
          <a class="ra-inline-link" href={prefix+"features/"}>{t.closerLink} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="ra-final shell-width" id="install" aria-labelledby="ra-final-title">
        <span class="ra-section-index">{t.finalEyebrow}</span>
        <h2 id="ra-final-title">{t.finalHeading}<br/><em>{t.finalHeadingEm}</em></h2>
        <p>{t.finalDesc}</p>
        <div class="ra-terminal">
          <div class="ra-terminal-head"><span><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><b>terminal / raohane</b><button type="button" data-ra-copy>{t.copy}</button></div>
          <pre><code>{installCommand}</code></pre>
        </div>
        <div class="ra-final-links"><a class="ra-button ra-button-primary" href={prefix+"install/"}>{t.guide} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="ra-button ra-button-text" href={github} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">{t.repo} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <SiteFooter lang={lang}/>
  </div>
  <script define:vars={{copied:t.copied,copy:t.copy,copyError:t.copyError,installCommand}}>
    document.querySelectorAll("[data-ra-moods]").forEach(function(root) {
      const buttons = root.querySelectorAll("[data-ra-palette]");
      const label = root.querySelector("[data-ra-mood-name]");
      buttons.forEach(function(button) {
        button.addEventListener("click", function() {
          root.dataset.palette = button.dataset.raPalette || "nocturne";
          buttons.forEach(function(other) { other.setAttribute("aria-pressed", String(other === button)); });
          const name = button.querySelector("b");
          if (label && name) label.textContent = name.textContent || "Nocturne";
        });
      });
    });
    document.querySelectorAll("[data-ra-copy]").forEach(function(button) {
      button.addEventListener("click", async function() {
        try {
          await navigator.clipboard.writeText(installCommand);
          button.textContent = copied;
          window.setTimeout(function() { button.textContent = copy; }, 1700);
        } catch (e) {
          button.textContent = copyError;
        }
      });
    });
  </script>
</BaseLayout>
